<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In SurveyBench: Can LLM(-Agents) Write Academic Surveys that Align with Reader Needs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Workflow of Topic-Specific Quiz Generation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In SurveyBench: Can LLM(-Agents) Write Academic Surveys that Align with Reader Needs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Topics Collected from CS Conferences</span></a></li>
