<td id="S3.T1.1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">3787</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Data-Driven Applications</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">695</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">19539</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Machine Learning Optimization functions</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">232</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">6327</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.1.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Modern AI &amp; Data Management</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">188</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">6125</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.1.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">General machine learning</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">397</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">11394</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.1.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Low-Level and Efficient Vision</td>
<td id="S3.T1.1.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">154</td>
