<span id="S3.T2.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:64.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Hard / 4</span>
</span></td>
