<figure id="A3.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="57" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 57" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.53 L 0 47.47 C 0 52.73 4.27 57 9.53 57 L 540.47 57 C 545.73 57 550 52.73 550 47.47 L 550 9.53 C 550 4.27 545.73 0 540.47 0 L 9.53 0 C 4.27 0 0 4.27 0 9.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.66 9.53 L 1.66 47.47 C 1.66 51.81 5.19 55.34 9.53 55.34 L 540.47 55.34 C 544.81 55.34 548.34 51.81 548.34 47.47 L 548.34 9.53 C 548.34 5.19 544.81 1.66 540.47 1.66 L 9.53 1.66 C 5.19 1.66 1.66 5.19 1.66 9.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.35 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.66em;--ltx-fo-height:1.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="30.06" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.98)" width="34.92em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><pre id="A3.F7.pic1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please write an acdamic survey on the topic of {topic}.

Note: Do not use existing relevant surveys as reference.
</pre></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Initial requirement prompt.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F8.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="270.94" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 270.94" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,270.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.53 L 0 261.4 C 0 266.67 4.27 270.94 9.53 270.94 L 540.47 270.94 C 545.73 270.94 550 266.67 550 261.4 L 550 9.53 C 550 4.27 545.73 0 540.47 0 L 9.53 0 C 4.27 0 0 4.27 0 9.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.66 9.53 L 1.66 261.4 C 1.66 265.75 5.19 269.27 9.53 269.27 L 540.47 269.27 C 544.81 269.27 548.34 265.75 548.34 261.4 L 548.34 9.53 C 548.34 5.19 544.81 1.66 540.47 1.66 L 9.53 1.66 C 5.19 1.66 1.66 5.19 1.66 9.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.35 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.66em;--ltx-fo-height:17.41em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="244" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 240.92)" width="34.92em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><pre id="A3.F8.pic1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Write a comprehensive academic survey on the given topic. The survey should be broad
in coverage, accessible to readers from newcomers to advanced researchers, and well-
structured. Please include: (1) formal definitions of key concepts; (2) diagrams, tables,
or figures where useful; (3) a historical timeline of major milestones; (4) coverage of
foundations, recent methods, open challenges, and applications across related subfields.
The coverage should be as broad as possible while emphasizing the most recent
developments. The writing style should balance technical depth with clarity, making the
content understandable for a wide audience while still rigorous and scholarly. Do not
rely on or reference existing surveys on similar topics; instead, construct the survey
independently based on fundamental sources and reasoning. The length and structure should
follow the conventions of standard academic surveys (e.g., multiple sections, sufficient
depth, and appropriate page count).
</pre></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Further requirement prompt.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Workflow of Topic-Specific Quiz Generation</h2>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Enhanced Q–A Generation with Guaranteed Target</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          Target number <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, Questions per segment <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, Max attempts <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          List of <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> Q–A pairs

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          Initialize <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results</span> <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ProcessedSegments</span> <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          Set <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">QualityThreshold</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow 0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow 0.7</annotation></semantics></math>, <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Attempts</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Phase 1: Progressive quality degradation
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\textit{Results}|&lt;N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\textit{Results}|&lt;N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Attempts</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;m</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Attempts</span> <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\textit{Attempts}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Attempts</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\textit{Attempts}+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q\leftarrow N-|\textit{Results}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\leftarrow N-|\textit{Results}|</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\leftarrow\min(\lceil q/k\rceil,10)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\leftarrow\min(\lceil q/k\rceil,10)</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Dynamic strategy adjustment
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Attempts</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;0.3m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;0.3m</annotation></semantics></math> or no segments found <span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">QualityThreshold</span> <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\max(\textit{QualityThreshold}-0.1,0.3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">QualityThreshold</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\max(\textit{QualityThreshold}-0.1,0.3)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
            Sample <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> segments with <span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">QualityThreshold</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> no segments and <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\textit{ProcessedSegments}|&gt;0.8\times\textit{Total}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">ProcessedSegments</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Total</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\textit{ProcessedSegments}|&gt;0.8\times\textit{Total}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ProcessedSegments</span> <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Reset for reuse
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for all</span> segment <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="seg" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">seg</annotation></semantics></math> not in <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ProcessedSegments</span> <span id="alg1.l15.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
             Generate Q–A pairs from <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="seg" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">seg</annotation></semantics></math> (up to <math id="alg1.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\min(k,q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min(k,q)</annotation></semantics></math> pairs)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> generation succeeds <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
               Add pairs to <span id="alg1.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results</span>, <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="seg" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">seg</annotation></semantics></math> to <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ProcessedSegments</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\textit{Results}|\geq N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\textit{Results}|\geq N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg1.l20.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span> 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while<span id="alg1.l23.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Phase 2: Fallback from successful segments
</span></span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\textit{Results}|&lt;N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\textit{Results}|&lt;N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for all</span> successful segment from <span id="alg1.l25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results</span> <span id="alg1.l25.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
            
            
             Generate additional pairs with relaxed validation

</div>
<div id="alg1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">27:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\textit{Results}|\geq N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Results</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\textit{Results}|\geq N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg1.l27.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span> 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">28:</span>
            
            
